---
import AboutFigure from './AboutFigure.astro';
---
<section class="au-section au-soft" aria-labelledby="company-archive" data-core-module data-module="historical-company-archive">
  <div class="au-wrap">
    <div class="au-section-heading"><h2 id="company-archive">Explore our special-vehicle history</h2><p>Historical yard and loading photographs from the wider vehicle business. Dated exhibitions and team activities appear in the stories above.</p></div>
    <div class="au-archive-images"><AboutFigure src="/images/company/factory-yard.webp" alt="Historical special-vehicle yard with trucks and visible Hubei Runli factory signage" caption="Historical special-vehicle yard · Hubei Runli signage" original="/images/company/factory-yard-original.jpg" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 90vw, 620px"/><AboutFigure src="/images/company/export-loading.webp" alt="Historical special-purpose truck being loaded onto a transport trailer" caption="Historical special-vehicle loading photograph" original="/images/company/export-loading-original.jpg" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 90vw, 620px"/></div>
    <p class="au-note au-archive-scope">Dates are not provided with these historical images. They do not establish a passenger-car factory, current stock or a completed customer delivery.</p>
    <details class="au-archive-context"><summary>What to request for your purchase</summary><p>An exhibition discussion records requirements. A vehicle check should identify the vehicle, date, inspector and findings. Loading or release records cover that handover stage; receiving and acceptance records are needed to confirm the completed delivery.</p><div class="au-actions"><a class="button button-outline" href="/export-services/sourcing-inspection/#scope">Inspection scope</a><a class="button button-outline" href="/export-services/buying-guide/car-import-documents-checklist/">Purchase documents</a></div></details>
  </div>
</section>
